‎## The Gap Identified
‎These aren't AI questions. They're infrastructure questions:
‎- Why can't I pay for this service?
‎- Why is my account restricted?
‎- What is an IP address?
‎- Why do some countries get access first?
‎- How do digital payments work?
‎- What is DNS?
‎- Why do trust scores matter?
‎
‎**We teach people how to use smartphones and apps.**
‎**We rarely teach them how the digital economy actually works.**
‎
‎## The Lens vs The Base
‎**HakunaShortcut** → Continues asking: "How is the digital economy evolving?"
‎Observes, interprets, develops frameworks.
‎
‎**Complementary Initiative** → Answers: "How does the digital economy actually function?"
‎Not academic. Practical knowledge base for first-time entrants.
‎
